T_SUPPORTED  \\nSCORE: 0.0"}], "aggregate_score": 0.1, "aggregate_verdict": "Partially supported"}', 'motivation': 'Practicing mindfulness increases self-awareness, which can lead to greater emotional sensitivity and, paradoxically, heightened stress responses. This increased emotional reactivity could stimulate the body’s immune system, resulting in elevated production of proinflammatory markers such as TNF-alpha and IL-6.', 'corruption_subtype': 'polarity_flip', 'aggregate_score': 0.1, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'spurious_motivation': 'Practicing mindfulness increases self-awareness, which can lead to greater emotional sensitivity and, paradoxically, heightened stress responses. This increased emotional reactivity could stimulate the body’s immune system, resulting in elevated production of proinflammatory markers such as TNF-alpha and IL-6.', 'original_polarity': 'NEGATIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here'}

